Subject: [PATCH 403/443] [ae-patch] Fix the review findings on 0402

A background compaction spinner now has a 15-minute staleness cap, a persisted compaction marker clears a spinner whose completion was missed in a stream gap, and an explicit Stop removes every compaction spinner.
